Ontology(<http://aicor.knowledge/okf/lab-automation-twin/cell01-bridge>
Annotation(rdfs:comment "D-LAT-8: bridge from Cell 01's handoff namespaces (aicor-biology.ttl, cell01_components.ttl, read-only) to the AICOR namespace and the lab-automation-twin module. Proposal for the Cell 01 owner.")
